## 5. Types of Transformers

| Type | Best for | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| **Encoder-only** | Understanding text (classification, search, NER) | BERT, RoBERTa |
| **Decoder-only** | Generating text (chatbots, code, writing) | GPT, Claude, Llama |
| **Encoder-Decoder** | Translation, summarization | Original Transformer, T5, BART |

The diagram in Section 4 shows the **encoder-decoder** design. Most modern chat LLMs use the **decoder-only** design.

